        "I^2=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\!\\!\\int_0^\\infty e^{-r^2}\\,r\\,dr\\,d\\theta",
        "\\int_0^\\infty re^{-r^2}dr=\\Big[-\\tfrac12e^{-r^2}\\Big]_0^\\infty=\\tfrac12",
